    {
      "label": "Description",
      "value": [
        "You create a 20-foot-radius Sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The Sphere is Heavily Obscured. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (such as one created by Gust of Wind) disperses it.",
        "Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot. The fog’s radius increases by 20 feet for each spell slot level above 1."
      ],
      "html": "<div> <p>You create a 20-foot-radius <a>Sphere</a> of fog centered on a point within range. The Sphere is <a>Heavily Obscured</a>. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (such as one created by <a>Gust of Wind</a>) disperses it.</p> <p><strong><em>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</em></strong> The fog’s radius increases by 20 feet for each spell slot level above 1.</p> </div>",
